      <annotation addr="207F:103F">BIOS Video Services
VIDEO - SET INDIVIDUAL DAC REGISTER (VGA/MCGA)

AX = 1010h
BX = register number
CH = new value for green (0-63)
CL = new value for blue (0-63)
DH = new value for red (0-63)</annotation>
      <annotation addr="207F:1031">BIOS Video Services
Set video mode AH = ah ^ ah = 00h</annotation>
      <annotation addr="207F:0BB9">BIOS Video Services
Set palette AH=0Bh, BH = 01h

VIDEO - SET COLOR PALETTE
BH = 00h, BL = border color
BH = 01h, BL = palette (0-3)</annotation>
      <annotation addr="207F:0B97">BIOS Keyboard Service
Read Character 0h = xor ah,ah = 0h

KEYBOARD - READ CHAR FROM BUFFER, WAIT IF EMPTY
Return: AH = scan code, AL = character</annotation>
      <annotation addr="207F:0B83">BIOS Video Services
Set Video Mode ah = 00h
AL = mode</annotation>
      <annotation addr="207F:3553">DOS Close File with Handle
BX = file handle</annotation>
